# Ubuntu-owned files that aurora-base replaces (one absolute path per line).
# The Selene version ships as <file>.selene (a conffile of aurora-base); preinst diverts Ubuntu's file to
# <file>.ubuntu (dpkg-divert --rename: the Ubuntu package's updates land there), postinst points <file> at
# <file>.selene with a symlink, postrm gives Ubuntu's file back (config-package-dev's "displace" scheme: a conffile
# itself is never diverted). dpkg refuses to install aurora-base when a rootfs/ file belongs to another package
# and is not listed here (iso/build.sh then names the file).
/etc/greetd/config.toml
/etc/systemd/zram-generator.conf
